{{also|wanze}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|goh|wantlūs||bedbug (lit., wall louse, [[wall-louse]], walllouse)}}, equivalent to {{compound|de|Wand|Laus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈvantsə/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Wanze.ogg|Audio}}
* {{rhymes|de|antsə|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Wan|ze}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Wanzen}}

# [[bedbug]]
# specifically, any insect of the suborder [[Heteroptera]]
# [[bug]], [[wire]], {{lb|de|espionage}} [[wiretap]]

====Declension====
{{de-decl-noun-f|n}}

====Synonyms====
* {{q|bedbug, [[Cimex lectularius]]}} {{l|de|Gemeine Bettwanze}}, {{l|de|Bettwanze}}, {{l|de|Hauswanze}}, {{l|de|Wandlaus}} {{q|older term}}
* {{q|bug, wiretap}} {{l|de|Abhörgerät}}, {{l|de|Abhörwanze}}

